    "title": "MC Works Explosion 818 CTR SP",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Experience the full power of the Explosion range with the 818CTR Special Model. Perfect for targeting GT and kingfish with larger stickbaits, this rod features a soft tip for precise control and a sturdy backbone for effortless casting and smooth action. This rod is the ultimate choice for topwater stickbaiting, providing a crisp, powerful, and forgiving experience.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>The backbone is the most superior out of the Explosion range rated at a max PE10 and enough power to turn a large GT or Kingfish. Suitable for anglers chasing the new PB fish. This rod can be fished with PE8 or 10 and will cause less fatigue on the angler.<br /><br />Handmade in Japan&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Specifications:<br />- Type: Spinning<br />- Pcs: 2pcs (butt joint)&nbsp;<br />- Length:&nbsp;8'1&quot;<br />- Line: PE # 8-12<br />- Casting range: 150-300g<br />- Drag max: 20kg<br /><br />Guides:&nbsp;Fuji TITANIUM HYBRID PMNSG + KWSG</p>",
